# TrustLedger configuration.
#
# This project no longer uses a local backend or .env secrets.
#
# - Frontend: a static build; its backend config lives in
#   frontend/src/lib/backendConfig.ts (kept in sync with Enter Cloud).
# - Backend + AI/LLM: run inside the deployed backend function
#   (trustledger-api) which reads the managed Enter AI token
#   (AI_API_TOKEN_11a386b24a34) from its own secure environment —
#   no API key belongs in this file.
# - Database, auth and storage are managed by Enter Cloud.
#
# No environment variables are required to build, run or publish this app.
